**Play it here:** https://lifestyle-discussions-famous-marshall.trycloudflare.com

**What was built:** \`index.html\` — IRONLINE // Sector 7 Perimeter (OP: DUSTWALL), a self-contained vanilla HTML/CSS/JS top-down tactical arcade shooter in one compact arena. Original names/assets only (Vanguard-1 vs Jackal/Trooper/Bulwark), restrained military-console style, procedural WebAudio cues, no external dependencies. Meets all acceptance criteria: WASD/arrows move + pointer aim/fire, 12-hostile wave with hit-flash/knockback/floaters/death bursts, HP/ammo/reload HUD, MISSION COMPLETE victory and OPERATOR DOWN defeat overlays, START/RESTART/REDEPLOY buttons + R/Enter keys.

**Final commit:** \`2e33360\` on branch \`opencode/34074032242\` (pushed; no PR per instructions) — adds \`index.html\` + 8 screenshots under \`screenshots/\`.

**Deployment status:** public Cloudflare URL serves the game (HTTP 200 on \`/\` and \`/index.html\`); local \`app-server\` tmux session on port 3000 also serves it (HTTP 200).

**Test status (Chromium/puppeteer-core, run against both port 3000 and the public URL):** movement, aim, hold-to-fire, kills scored, ammo drain + R reload, pause, victory overlay + R restart to fresh 12-hostile run, defeat overlay + button restart — all passing with **zero console/page errors**.

**Screenshots (captured from the public URL):**
![menu](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/opencode/34074032242/screenshots/final-public-menu.png)
![gameplay](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/opencode/34074032242/screenshots/final-public-gameplay.png)
![victory](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/opencode/34074032242/screenshots/final-public-victory.png)
![defeat](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/opencode/34074032242/screenshots/final-public-defeat.png)

**Known limitations:**
- Single fixed arena and one 12-hostile wave only; no levels, persistence, or mobile/touch controls.
- Victory/defeat overlay screenshots for the end states were triggered via the in-page debug hook after live gameplay verification, so their stats lines reflect the test (real clears always show 12/12).
- WebAudio cues require a user gesture to unlock the AudioContext (standard autoplay policy).
- Public URL is a temporary Cloudflare tunnel, not a permanent host." 2>&1
